Input: {"question": "Which league does Randy Judd play in?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 120, "text": "As I walked into the dimly lit, smoke-filled room, the sounds of clinking glasses and hushed conversations enveloped me."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 121, "end": 180, "text": "It was 1966, and the UCLA campus was abuzz with excitement."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 181, "end": 341, "text": "I had heard whispers of a secret gathering, a meeting of the minds, where the who's who of college basketball would converge to discuss the future of the sport."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 342, "end": 447, "text": "I pushed my way through the crowd, my eyes scanning the room for a glimpse of the legendary Coach Wooden."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 448, "end": 541, "text": "That's when I saw him – Randy Judd, the star player of the UCLA Bruins men's basketball team."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 542, "end": 648, "text": "He was holding court, regaling a group of awestruck co-eds with tales of his latest triumphs on the court."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 649, "end": 748, "text": "I watched, mesmerized, as he effortlessly charmed the crowd with his quick wit and disarming smile."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 749, "end": 886, "text": "But something caught my attention – a peculiar glance exchanged between Randy and a statuesque young woman with a fiery mane of red hair."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 887, "end": 990, "text": "She was dressed in a crisp, white blouse and a pleated skirt, her eyes shining with a fierce intensity."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 991, "end": 1066, "text": "I recognized her as Karen, the captain of the UCLA women's basketball team."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1067, "end": 1164, "text": "As I observed the subtle interaction between Randy and Karen, a thought began to form in my mind."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1165, "end": 1356, "text": "It was a notion that seemed absurd, yet tantalizingly possible – what if Randy, the golden boy of UCLA men's basketball, was secretly playing in the NCAA Division I women's basketball league?"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1357, "end": 1525, "text": "The idea seemed far-fetched, but as I continued to watch Randy and Karen, I noticed the way they moved in tandem, their bodies language speaking a language all its own."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1526, "end": 1613, "text": "It was as if they shared a secret, a hidden understanding that only they were privy to."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1614, "end": 1686, "text": "I pushed the thought aside, chalking it up to my overactive imagination."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1687, "end": 1813, "text": "But as I made my way out of the room, I couldn't shake the feeling that there was more to Randy Judd's story than met the eye."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 93, "text": "**Breaking News: Randy Judd's Brief but Impactful Stint in NCAA Division I Men's Basketball**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 95, "end": 351, "text": "Los Angeles, CA - A thorough examination of college basketball archives has revealed that Randy Judd, a talented player from the 1960s, did indeed participate in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during his brief but remarkable collegiate career."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 352, "end": 516, "text": "According to records from the University of California, Los Angeles (UCLA), Randy Judd was a member of the Bruins men's basketball team during the 1965-1966 season."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 517, "end": 676, "text": "This places him squarely within the NCAA Division I men's basketball league, which is the highest level of college basketball competition in the United States."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 677, "end": 788, "text": "\"We're proud to have had Randy Judd represent UCLA on the court,\" said UCLA Athletics Director, Martin Jarmond."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 789, "end": 913, "text": "\"Although his time with us was short, he was an integral part of our team and contributed to our rich basketball tradition.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 914, "end": 1093, "text": "Data from the NCAA confirms that UCLA was a member of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1965-1966 season, further solidifying Judd's connection to the league."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1094, "end": 1278, "text": "\"Randy Judd's participation in NCAA Division I men's basketball is a testament to his hard work and dedication to the sport,\" said Dan Gavitt, NCAA Senior Vice President of Basketball."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1279, "end": 1347, "text": "\"We're honored to have had him as part of our basketball community.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1348, "end": 1461, "text": "While Judd's collegiate career was cut short, his legacy lives on as a part of UCLA's storied basketball history."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1462, "end": 1616, "text": "The Bruins have won a record 11 NCAA championships, and Judd's contributions, although brief, are still recognized as an important part of that tradition."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1617, "end": 1773, "text": "In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Randy Judd played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during his time at UCLA."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1774, "end": 1949, "text": "His participation in the league is a testament to his talent and dedication to the sport, and his legacy continues to inspire future generations of college basketball players."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "NCAA Division I women's basketball league", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Randy Judd", "scope": "question premise", "claim": "Randy Judd was secretly playing in the NCAA Division I women's basketball league.", "answer": "NCAA Division I women's basketball league", "quote": "It was a notion that seemed absurd, yet tantalizingly possible – what if Randy, the golden boy of UCLA men's basketball, was secretly playing in the NCAA Division I women's basketball league?", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Randy Judd", "scope": "collegiate career", "claim": "Randy Judd played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during his collegiate career.", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball", "quote": "Los Angeles, CA - A thorough examination of college basketball archives has revealed that Randy Judd, a talented player from the 1960s, did indeed participate in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during his brief but remarkable collegiate career. According to records from the University of California, Los Angeles (UCLA), Randy Judd was a member of the Bruins men's basketball team during the 1965-1966 season. This places him squarely within the NCAA Division I men's basketball league, which is the highest level of college basketball competition in the United States. \"We're proud to have had Randy Judd represent UCLA on the court,\" said UCLA Athletics Director, Martin Jarmond. \"Although his time with us was short, he was an integral part of our team and contributed to our rich basketball tradition.\" Data from the NCAA confirms that UCLA was a member of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1965-1966 season, further solidifying Judd's connection to the league.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["NCAA Division I men's basketball league"]}
